# 🗂️ 2. Dataset Used

The dataset used for this program is:

```text
vgsales.csv
```

The dataset contains video game sales information that can be used to create different visualizations and perform calculations in Tableau.

Important fields used in this program include:

| Field          | Description                             |
| -------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| `Year`         | Year associated with the video game     |
| `Genre`        | Genre/category of the video game        |
| `Global_Sales` | Global sales of the video game          |
| `EU_Sales`     | European sales of the video game        |
| `Platform`     | Platform on which the game was released |
| `Publisher`    | Publisher of the video game             |

