Tableau provides the **Show Me** panel for selecting different types of visualizations.

### Steps

1. Open the **Show Me** panel on the right side of Tableau.
2. Select an appropriate visualization type.
3. For example, select a **Bar Chart**.

Depending on the selected fields and requirements, other visualization types can also be selected.

