# 🎨 6. Formatting the Chart

Formatting improves the readability and appearance of a Tableau visualization.

---

## 6.1 Formatting the Axis

The Global Sales axis can be formatted to change its appearance.

### Steps

1. Right-click on the **Global Sales axis**.
2. Select **Format**.
3. The Format pane appears.
4. Adjust the required formatting options such as:

   * Font style
   * Font size
   * Alignment
   * Number formatting

The formatting can be adjusted according to the requirements of the visualization.

---

## 6.2 Adding a Chart Title

A descriptive title can be added to the visualization.

Example:

```text
Global Sales by Year
```

### Steps

1. Click the chart title area.
2. Edit the title.
3. Enter:

```text
