# 📝 7. Adding Annotations

Annotations can be used to highlight a specific data point or provide additional information.

### Steps

1. Right-click on the mark/data point that you want to highlight.
2. Select:

```text
Annotate
   ↓
Mark
```

3. Enter the required annotation.
4. Click **OK**.

